                                                "text": "Nonetheless, especially polytraumatized patients and patients with acute neurological disorders such as cerebral ischemia or intracranial hemorrhage might benefit from a short acquisition time using spiral acquisitions, as they are agitated and often difficult to handle during the CT examination [7 ]."
